# Repository tools that belong to no package. Compiled into
# requirements_lock.txt together with the five pyproject.toml files; refresh
# with `bazel run //tools:update_requirements_lock`.
uv
# Reads pyproject.toml files in //tools:deps_consistency_test (stdlib tomllib
# from Python 3.11).
tomli
# Lint and format: //tools:ruff and the ruff_test targets (tools/lint.bzl).
ruff
# Type checking: the mypy_test targets (tools/typecheck.bzl).
mypy
# Docs versions on gh-pages (E09-21): the local `mike` CLI (mike list, alias,
# delete) and the versions.json reader the publish tool's test checks against.
# The site itself is always the Bazel build, never `mike deploy`.
mike
